WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.436
Rialé tun be yen.

00:00:01.516 --> 00:00:04.556
A tun be elefanw gbɛnna a kelen na.

00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:10.263
A ka sunguru ta k'a janto a ra, ka taga a bla a yɛrɛ ta so kɔnɔ.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:15.434
Dɔɔni dɔɔni, lonancɛ ni jagokɛla y'a daminɛ ka ɲɔgɔn kanu.
